{
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The London Borough of Hounslow as the Local Planning Authority hereby certify that on 10 June 2024, the use of 192 Vicarage Farm Road TW5 0DP as a Large House in Multiple Occupation (HMO) (Sui Generis) is not lawful within the meaning of Section 191 of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 for the following reason:\r\nThe applicant has failed to submit sufficient information to evidence that, on the balance of probabilities, the property has been in use as a Large HMO for the continuous period of ten years.\r\n"
